			pres. in use, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσοράω</span>
		being used instead:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>look at</i> or <i>upon</i>, <i><span class="en">
